<h1>About @Cfg["Seo:SiteName"]</h1>
<div class="card">
  <p>@Cfg["Seo:SiteName"] offers free online calculators and file tools that are quick to use and easy to understand. Our goal is simple: tools that work instantly, on any device, without sign-ups.</p>
  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>This site is built and maintained by @Cfg["Site:Owner"], a software developer. Tell visitors a little about yourself here (your background, why you built the site). Real, specific details help users and reviewers trust the site.</p>
  <h2>How our tools work</h2>
  <p>Calculators and the dice roller run entirely in your browser, so what you type stays on your device. File tools such as JPG to PDF process your files in memory and discard them straight after the result is created. We do not keep your files.</p>
  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>We test our calculators, but results are estimates for general information. Please double-check anything important, such as grades or financial decisions, with an official source or a qualified professional.</p>
  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>Found a bug or want a new tool? Please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
</div>
